         [1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3],
         [4, 5, 6, 4, 5, 6]], dtype=int32)>

  Args:
    input: A `Tensor`. Can be of any rank.
    multiples: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `int32`, `int64`.
